  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the end of three years from the date of this permission.\r\n\r\nReason: In order to comply with the provisions of Section 91 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).\r\n\r\n",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans: (P21-050-0419-)01 rev A, 02 rev A, 05 rev C, 06 rev D; Heritage Statement from Planware Limited dated February 2026; Reasonable Exception Statement (Fire strategy) from Planware Limited received 05/02/2026; Data Sheet & Conformity Certificate (rolled products/cladding) from Hulamin Operations (Pty) Ltd. dated 2024.\r\n\r\nReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interest of proper planning.\r\n",
    "Condition : 3 - All new external work shall be carried out in materials that resemble, as closely as possible, in colour and texture those of the existing building, unless otherwise specified in the approved application. \r\n\r\nReason: To safeguard the appearance of the premises and the character of the immediate area in accordance with the requirements of policies D1 and D2 of the London Borough of Camden Local Plan 2017.\r\n",
    "Condition : 4 - No part of the resurfaced 1st floor level flat roof area at the front of the application site as shown on approved drawing P21-050-0419-06 rev D shall be used as a roof terrace, sitting out area or other amenity space. \r\n \r\nReason: To protect the amenity of adjoining occupiers, and the amenity and appearance of the streetscene and Camden Town Conservation Area in accordance with policies A1, D1 and D2 of the Camden Local Plan 2017.\r\n\r\n \r\nReason: To protect the amenity of adjoining occupiers, and the amenity and appearance of the streetscene and Camden Town Conservation Area in accordance with policies A1, D1 and D2 of the Camden Local Plan 2017."
  ],
